 show(e.kind+' · 列国事件','<h3 class="detailTitle">'+escapeHTML(e.name)+'</h3><span class="datebadge">'+range(e.year,e.year,e.approx)+'</span>'+datingDetails(e.dating)+eventNarrative(e)+'<div class="detailSection"><h4>当年在位君主</h4><p class="notice">用于同年对照；已核实的实际即位年一并纳入，条带仍采用年表起点。在位不等于亲自参战或参与此事。</p>'+contemporaries+'</div><div class="detailSection"><h4>已收录的相关人物</h4><p class="notice">'+escapeHTML(e.participantCoverage)+'</p>'+e.participants.map(participantCard).join('')+'</div><div class="detailSection"><h4>原典与纪年核查</h4><p class="notice">原典提供记载，公元前年份由纪年表换算；有异说时分别列明。</p>'+links(e.sources)+'</div><div class="related"><button data-action="eventChart" data-id="'+e.id+'">查看图上联动</button></div>','event:'+id);
